    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d27">

                <pb facs="0094" n="74" xml:id="pg74"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Harvey, United
                        States minister, to Mr. Seward, Secretary of
                        State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Lisbon</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1864-01-20"><hi rendition="#italic">January</hi> 20,
                        1864</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: The accompanying copy of a note from the
                    Duke de Soule, in answer to one which I addressed to him on the 14th instant, in
                    reference to the arming of piratical cruisers in Portuguese ports, was only
                    received last night, though dated on the 16th instant.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>JAMES E. HARVEY.</signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Secretary of State.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d27-a1.xml" xpointer="d27-a1"/>
            </div>
